set vsys vsys1 rulebase security rules z from any to any source any destination any application any service any action allow
set vsys vsys2 rulebase security rules d from any to any source 192.0.2.0/24 destination 198.51.100.0/24 application any service any action deny
set vsys vsys2 rulebase security rules z2 from any to any source any destination any application any service any action allow
set vsys vsys1 import network interface [ ethernet1/1 ethernet1/2 ]
set network interface ethernet ethernet1/1 layer3 ip 192.0.2.1/24
set network interface ethernet ethernet1/2 layer3 ip 198.51.100.1/24
